    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "gContent",
      "anchor": "gcontent"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`gContent` is the content-capability group that composes the `cms` and `wcms` modules. It contributes shared configuration but leaves schemas, services, routers, data, and tests to its child modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Dependencies",
      "anchor": "dependencies"
    },
    {
      "kind": "unordered-list",
      "items": [
        "`cms`",
        "`wcms`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Customization",
      "anchor": "customization"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Projects should override content behavior in later-index modules through schemas, services, routers, pipelines, data, and configuration rather than changing this group module."
    }
